<section class="phero"><div class="phero-bg"><img src="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/laptop-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="100vw" width="960" height="638" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.18"></div><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Calculators</li></ol></nav><p class="kicker">Free &amp; private</p><h1>Free Insurance Claim Calculators for Maryland</h1><p class="lede">Seven calculators and planners built from real appraisal work. Check the insurer’s math, map your deadlines and decide on next steps — no sign-up and nothing stored.</p></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="igrid" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Estimator</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Claim Gap &amp; Fee Estimator</h2><p>Size the dispute, test a scenario award and subtract appraiser and umpire fees to see a realistic net.</p><span class="more">Open estimator <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-worksheet/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/notebook-calculator.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/notebook-calculator-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/notebook-calculator.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="641" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Worksheet</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>RCV / ACV &amp; Holdback Worksheet</h2><p>List damaged items with age and life expectancy to see the first payment, the holdback and the full RCV.</p><span class="more">Open worksheet <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/roof-square-pitch-calculator/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/slate-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/slate-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/slate-roof.webp 1000w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1000" height="667" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Calculator</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Roof Square &amp; Pitch Calculator</h2><p>Turn a footprint into true roof squares with pitch and waste, from flat rowhouse roofs to steep Victorians.</p><span class="more">Open calculator <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/bay-bridge-aerial.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/bay-bridge-aerial-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/bay-bridge-aerial.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="808" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Calculator</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Hurricane Deductible Calculator</h2><p>Convert a percentage hurricane or named-storm deductible into dollars and compare it with a flat deductible.</p><span class="more">Open calculator <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/signing.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/signing-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/signing.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Planner</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Claim Timeline Planner</h2><p>Map notice, proof-of-loss, depreciation and time-to-sue dates from your date of loss, then export them.</p><span class="more">Open planner <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checklist/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consultation.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consultation-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consultation.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Checklist</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Appraisal Readiness Checklist</h2><p>Twelve yes/no questions score your file and build a to-do list before you invoke appraisal.</p><span class="more">Open checklist <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraisal-calculators/snow-load-roof-estimator/"><span class="ic-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-chimney.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-chimney-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-chimney.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="ic-n sm">Estimator</span></span><span class="ic-b"><h2>Snow &amp; Ice Roof Load Estimator</h2><p>Estimate how much snow and ice weigh on your roof after a big storm, compared with a reference design load.</p><span class="more">Open estimator <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker dark">Suggested order</p><h2>Using the calculators together</h2><ol class="numlist"><li>Start with the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-timeline-planner/">claim timeline planner</a> so nothing lapses.</li><li>Check roof math with the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/roof-square-pitch-calculator/">roof square &amp; pitch calculator</a>.</li><li>See what you’re owed with the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/hurricane-deductible-calculator/">hurricane deductible</a> and <a href="/appraisal-calculators/rcv-acv-holdback-worksheet/">RCV / ACV</a> tools.</li><li>Size the dispute with the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/claim-gap-fee-estimator/">claim gap &amp; fee estimator</a>.</li><li>Finish with the <a href="/appraisal-calculators/appraisal-readiness-checklist/">readiness checklist</a>.</li></ol></div><div class="rv"><div class="box box-call"><h2 class="box-h">Talk to an appraiser</h2><p>A free first conversation about your estimate — and a straight answer on whether appraisal fits.</p><a class="box-tel" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg>(844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn brass block" href="/start-a-claim-review/">Send claim details</a><small>Mon–Fri, 8am–6pm ET</small></div></div></div></section>
